Welcome to this changelog !

=================================================================

0.6.0-beta - August 8th 2026 : Bugfix release (fork)

 - Use the DISM installed with the OS by default (always up to date) ;
   the bundled DISM folder is only used as a fallback
 - Fix empty index names in the index list (FOR variable collision)
 - Fix support for paths containing spaces (proper quoting everywhere,
   user-pasted quotes are stripped automatically)
 - Fix crash caused by GOTO to the non-existent label "IndexExport"
 - Fix the broken Administrator elevation prompt (invalid SET params syntax)
 - Fix the start-over flow ('S') which re-ran parts of the script twice
 - Fix error detection : DISM exit codes are now actually checked,
   including inside the "export all indexes" loop
 - Fix index parsing on non-English systems (DISM is called with /English)
 - ESD -> WIM preset now uses Maximum compression instead of Recovery
 - Add input validation for the index number and an existence check
   for the source image
 - Add a clear error screen when no DISM executable can be found

